# PERSONAL_PORTFOLIO_WORKPLAN.md

# Project Overview

Create a professional yet artistic personal portfolio website for internship and future job applications.

The website should combine:
- engineering and coding projects
- artistic and creative identity
- resume and professional experience
- personal archive and storytelling

The visual direction should feel:
- artistic
- dreamy
- hand-drawn
- slightly Van Gogh inspired
- soft blue-green color palette
- professional but personal

The website will be built primarily using:
- HTML
- CSS
- basic JavaScript if needed
- GitHub Pages
- VS Code
- AI-assisted workflows

