# TASK 1 — Resume Section

Create a professional resume page using information from the provided resume PDF.

Requirements:
- clean professional layout
- maintain artistic visual theme
- include:
    - education
    - work experience
    - activities
    - leadership
    - skills
    - contact information

Design Notes:
- should feel modern and clean
- should NOT feel like a plain PDF copy
- use section cards or timeline layout
- maintain readable typography
- preserve professionalism

Possible Features:
- downloadable PDF button
- smooth scrolling
- section navigation

---

# TASK 2 — Engineering Projects Section

Create the first engineering project showcase page.

Primary project:
- ATG / 11A engineering project

Requirements:
- project overview
- technologies used
- screenshots
- role and contribution
- engineering/design process
- challenges and solutions
- project link and GitHub link if available

Design Notes:
- reusable project card system
- reusable subpage structure
- responsive layout
- visually consistent with homepage

Possible Features:
- image gallery
- hover animations
- expandable sections
- timeline/process visualization

